      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:aaa8c244b1ea116f518ef35f1de6baa817fbf24d93b6ac0545d76f7257dc2dba\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:77951d72df4736cde83300004b4909214159181804564d4a734841fcfc138f09\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f6c5aad41d4589b42ea1c0a36b97752e8117c829b8ca24067e2daf717eca3e7b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2bf17bb6ce41b3ca9ebc30afbc753221bacfd0f271b538f514195166c3f1f2c0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:faa73eedfc93cf26c11db59dfe576da0944839d87fe0dc4dd6188e7431dd3edf\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c9ead08f2f49a176688c92e0c60a00b96c318c01ffded7432f452ad640b21904\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3c8ae4814924ebda7a719249ac1c8214a37fefec2cedcc46d775226a36d5db26\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3a0c24378d4ceac11babc7005f8d4506daf1fd126e3d2a35e392c285b0bd7879\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:db030aaa7591bbb95cdd8a7d2af637e066983ba3ac2be947dc67a9634c820750\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"choice_text\":\"An eligible employee must satisfy all three conditions: (1) has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months; (2) has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave (subject to special hours of service rules under § 825.801 for airline flight crew employees); and (3) is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite (referencing § 825.105(b) regarding employees working outside the U.S.).\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"29 CFR 825.110 — Eligible employee.\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":590,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":103,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:103:sha256-f65766fc8c1d9018ff7f6a685d59a802898d9b888c3de0a8c3c4756b5c8959a4\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":35,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3