hs, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:db030aaa7591bbb95cdd8a7d2af637e066983ba3ac2be947dc67a9634c820750\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:3b231aa47e0857ec41ba9ff33fb34603707b4d568d95f1dec6601898e78c08ef\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"references\":[\"§ 825.801\",\"§ 825.105(b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:b8284a8dda098aa0555e8048515aa5dff1a6d2b0a9ec004ed544859a1526214e\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For an employee of a covered employer under 29 CFR 825.110\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":37,\"summary\":\"An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave (subject to § 825.801 for airline flight crew employees), and is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite (referencing § 825.105(b) for employees working outside the U.S.).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
