      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "In order to determine the hours that would have been worked during the period of absence from work due to or necessitated by USERRA-covered service, the employee's pre-service work schedule can generally be used for calculations (referencing § 825.801(c) for airline flight crew employees).",
